I'm not sure what to do Just
look at it I'm not looking at

359
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:32,237
it I'm not sure what to do
I'm just thinking I don't know

360
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:38,837
I know I'm not sure I'm not
sure what to do It's not just

361
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:42,517
like I'm not sure It's a

362
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:48,140
feeling I'm not sure I'm not sure
